kuayle — the official Kuayle CLI

## Global Flags

  --profile NAME, --url URL, --workspace SLUG (env: KUAYLE_PROFILE, KUAYLE_URL, KUAYLE_WORKSPACE)
  --format human|json (default: human on a terminal, JSON when piped; errors too)
  --no-cache (env: KUAYLE_NO_CACHE) skips the 5-minute name cache

## Authentication

  kuayle auth login --url URL --workspace SLUG --token <PAT>

## Commands

  kuayle auth login
  kuayle auth logout
  kuayle auth status
  kuayle whoami
  kuayle workspaces list
  kuayle issues list
  kuayle issues read
  kuayle issues create
  kuayle issues update
  kuayle issues delete
  kuayle issues batch-update
  kuayle issues batch-delete
  kuayle issues history
  kuayle issues sub-issues-list
    List sub-issues
  kuayle issues sub-issues-create
    Create a sub-issue
  kuayle comments list
  kuayle comments create
  kuayle comments resolve
  kuayle comments reopen
  kuayle relations list
  kuayle relations create
  kuayle relations delete
  kuayle labels list
  kuayle labels create
  kuayle labels update
  kuayle labels delete
  kuayle teams list
  kuayle teams read
  kuayle statuses list
  kuayle projects list
  kuayle projects read
  kuayle cycles list
  kuayle cycles read
  kuayle cycles burndown
  kuayle cycles velocity
  kuayle templates list
  kuayle templates read
  kuayle templates create
  kuayle templates update
  kuayle templates delete
  kuayle views list
  kuayle views read
  kuayle members list
  kuayle favorites list
  kuayle notifications list
  kuayle assets upload
    Upload a file (max 10 MB); prints its asset ID and URL
  kuayle assets download
    Download an asset to a file (default ./asset-<id>), or "-" for stdout
  kuayle wiki list
    List pages (registry days are hidden unless --registry)
  kuayle wiki tree
    Show the page tree (folders and nesting)
  kuayle wiki read
    Read a page
  kuayle wiki create
    Create a page or folder
  kuayle wiki update
    Update a page's title and/or content
  kuayle wiki delete
    Delete a page
  kuayle wiki move
    Move a page under a parent (or top level) at a position
  kuayle wiki history
    List a page's revisions, newest first
  kuayle wiki restore
    Restore a page to a revision from its history
  kuayle registry settings
    Show whether the registry is on; --enable or --disable to change it
  kuayle registry append
    Add an entry to today's (UTC) registry page
  kuayle registry feed
    Show registry days, newest first
  kuayle registry overview
    List AI overviews of the registry, newest first
  kuayle registry generate-overview
    Generate an AI overview for a period (at most 31 days)
  kuayle agent-tasks list
    List the workspace's agent task queue
  kuayle agent-tasks read
    Show one agent task
  kuayle agent-tasks history
    Show a task's state transitions
  kuayle agent-tasks runs
    List a task's runs
  kuayle workflows list
    List workflows and the workspace defaults
  kuayle workflows read
    Show one workflow, including its graph
  kuayle workflows profiles
    List agent profiles
  kuayle usage
    Show command reference
  kuayle completion
    Generate shell completion script
  kuayle self-update
    Check for updates or update the binary
## Name Resolution

  Teams, projects, labels and people accept a name, key, email or UUID
  (case-insensitive); an unknown name lists candidates and exits 3.

## Wiki and Registry

  wiki/registry commands need --team <name|key|id> or --project <name|id>.
  Content is HTML or Markdown (--content, or --file PATH|-).
  Token scopes: wiki:read to read, wiki:write to change.
  agent-tasks/workflows need agent_tasks:read / workflows:read (members only).

## Exit Codes

  0 ok, 1 error, 2 auth, 3 not found, 4 invalid input, 5 forbidden,
  6 rate limited, 7 network/server

## Output Format

  Prefer --format json in scripts and agents.
